{
  "description": "The body of an HTTP batch (REQ-OUT-010): one JSON object { schema_version, events } in the canonical form, so both languages give the same bytes. The gzipped body is not compared byte for byte (two gzip encoders give different bytes): it must decompress to exactly this text and carry Content-Encoding: gzip.",
